# HakiOS fragment for the Samsung Galaxy A52s 5G (SM-A528B, a52sxq) ONLY.
# No phone-specific boot arguments have been verified on this device, so none are set here.
# The Redwood fragment's haptic id (5) and its modem buffer address belong to a Xiaomi
# phone and MUST NOT be copied into an A52s configuration. No addresses are guessed here.
CONFIG_DEVICE="a52sxq"
